1
00:00:00,046 --> 00:00:02,326
(Howard:)-Sheldon?
-Zone.

2
00:00:03,749 --> 00:00:06,229
(Leonard:)He'll figure it out
when he falls off the roof.

3
00:00:09,922 --> 00:00:12,332
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I know you're in the zone,
but do you want some tea?

4
00:00:16,929 --> 00:00:19,269
(Leonard:)All right, I can't believe
I'm gonna say this, but

5
00:00:19,432 --> 00:00:21,772
(Leonard:)you haven't spoken in hours
and I'm starting to get worried.

6
00:00:21,934 --> 00:00:23,104
(Leonard:)Please say something.

7
00:00:23,269 --> 00:00:27,949
(Sheldon:)Leonard, prepare to be humbled
and weep at the glory of my genius.

8
00:00:29,442 --> 00:00:31,182
(Leonard:)Nope, it was better before.

9
00:00:32,611 --> 00:00:34,091
(Sheldon:)Look at it.

10
00:00:34,246 --> 00:00:36,696
(Sheldon:)I feel like my mind just made a baby.

11
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:40,360
(Sheldon:)And it's beautiful.

12
00:00:40,519 --> 00:00:43,399
(Sheldon:)It's not like human babies,
which are loud and covered in goop.

13
00:00:45,224 --> 00:00:48,264
(Leonard:)Holy crap, Sheldon,
did you just figure out a method

14
00:00:48,427 --> 00:00:51,037
(Leonard:)for synthesizing a new stable
super-heavy element?

15
00:00:51,864 --> 00:00:54,604
(Sheldon:)Did I?
Well, that can't be right.

16
00:00:54,767 --> 00:00:57,807
(Sheldon:)No one's ever done that before.
Except me, because I just did it!

17
00:00:58,704 --> 00:01:05,384
♪ Sheldon and his brain, yeah!
Sheldon and his brain, yeah!

